 <h3><u>Akhri azan sunli</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Akhri azan sunli</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Akhri azan to sunli, amaa achi meri amaa </font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Sine se lagalo marne ki riza do (Amma achi meri amma) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Ay Amma phuphi jaan ke do laal sidhare darya ka kanare tum apne jawan laal ko shabbir pe waro Amma achi meri amma </li>
    <p>Sine se lagalo marne ki riza do (Amma achi meri amma)x2</p>
    <li>Sehra tera bete ke muqadar me nahi tha ab wakht ye aya poshak -e-shahani ko kafan mera banalo Amma achi meri amma </li>
    <p>Sine se lagalo marne ki riza do (Amma achi meri amma)x2</p>
    <li>Wo dekho su-e-dashte bala madar-e-muztar gere he sitam gar kya bap ki nusrat na karu mujko bata do Amma achi meri amma </li>
    <p>Sine se lagalo marne ki riza do (Amma achi meri amma)x2</p>
    <li>Mana ke nahi bete ki furqat koyi aasan pan kya karu amma yeh sabre ki manzil hai zara dil ko sambhala lo Amma achi meri amma </li>
    <p>Sine se lagalo marne ki riza do (Amma achi meri amma)x2</p>
    <li>Khuch der me ye laal bhi keh layenga lasha hai ek tamana bimar -e madina ko madine se bula lo Amma achi meri amma </li>
    <p>Sine se lagalo marne ki riza do (Amma achi meri amma) x2</p>
    <li>Kya tumko gawara hai ke zindaa rahe beta aur katl ho baba me is liye kehta hu na jine ki saza do Amma achi meri amma </li>
    <p>Sine se lagalo marne ki riza do (Amma achi meri amma)x2</p>
    <li>Tarpongi shab -o- roz meri yaad de me har dam kerte huwe matam ik baar muje apne kaleje se laga lo Amma achi meri amma </li>
   </ol> <p>Sine se lagalo marne ki riza do (Amma achi meri amma) x2</p> </font>
